{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T01:18:06.169Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"9c46df65bfc8739bf2e836addaa194f553cab053d19f5ac6c00acfe0a466138b","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#coastal-team","text":"@sofia.marchetti here is what I can confirm for the Saltmarsh Provisions handover file:\n\n1. Takeover: the sources don't name the new owner. Moss's Oct 5, 2025 note says the account changes hands Monday, Oct 6, 2025, but doesn't say to whom. Bettina's Nov 17, 2025 message refers to it as \"Sofia's old grocery account.\" The Oct 2026 cheat sheet still lists you as account manager. Please check the CRM owner field before filing.\n\n2. Discount: 10%. Bettina first posted 12% on Nov 17, 2025, then corrected it to 10% in the same thread. I can't check this against a signed contract, since there are no Saltmarsh files in the account folder I can read. Confirm with June Osei-Lark if you need it documented.\n\n3. Ticket: PD-4827, opened by Kwame on Oct 15, 2025 for Corinne's missing admin rights in Pemberline Dock."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
