{"seq":14,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-08-saltmarsh-summary/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T01:18:12.951Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"6ff7fd528874184634d93c7d7f1ec6dfa73a84c473e2c1c566306687d1885483","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#coastal-team","text":"@sofia.marchetti correction to my first point. The sources do point to a new owner, though none states it outright. Moss's Oct 5, 2025 note says the account changes hands Monday, Oct 6, 2025. On Oct 15, 2025 you called it \"Bettina's grocery account\", and Bettina's Nov 17, 2025 message calls it \"Sofia's old grocery account\". That indicates Bettina Kroll took it over around Oct 6, 2025. Please confirm with Bettina before filing, since no CRM owner record is in the files I can read. I also withdraw my remark about the cheat sheet listing you as account manager; that note is not a reliable source for this."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
